UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'Will AI Replace Humans: #AI #artificialintelligence  #dystopia #technology #gpt4 #robots  This dude claims that by By 2024 you will be able to replace around 50% of your software devselopers with GPT-4 agents that run on 10$ worth of tokens per hour. They won’t need sleep or breaks, and will cost 1/10th the cost of a human.  this is the claim of Mckay Wrigley, who for the past few weeks has been building AI applications with no code, and he even built jarvis which is an app on his mac where he spoke to it, and it  - Built and designed a frontend - Created a backend with working db - Correctly hooked those up - Uploaded code to GitHub - Deployed it online Things are heating up.  Smoke-away on twitter stated the following in a tweet: - GPT-5 is coming. - Midjourney v6 is coming. - Stable Diffusion 3 is coming. - Google still hasn''t caught OpenAI. - Humanoid robots are in production. - DeepMind and Google Brain joined forces. - AutoGPTs are coming. And for those who don’t know, AutoGPT is basically ChatGPT that runs autonomously, has a memory, and has a goal, and is programmed to stop once it reaches that goal, and it uses the GPT-4 API to prompt itself different things until the goal is reached.  And Sully asked AutoGPT to build a website and it did it in 3 minutes.  The AI doomers say that this will kill us all for sure. Eliezer Yadkowski said that it’s not that AI hates us, its that Humans are made of atoms and those Atoms could be used for something else.  The technooptimists say that Artificial General intelligence will lead us to nucular fusion which will allow us to turn all salt water into fresh water for almost no cost, and we will even be able to solve aging. And I’m not sure I know where I stand on this matter, I’m no scientist, but I do know it’s almost impossible to stop. Companies have a fiduciary responsibility to their shareholders, which means that within the law, they have an obligation to make decisions that maximize share price, which if you ask me, is a mentality that has lead us into really really really fucked up situations time and time again.  All I can do is spread awareness as things unfold. Follow for that.' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7219692656186854702';
